### Task Manager API — VS Code REST Client (extensão humao.rest-client)
### Antes: python seed.py && python app.py
### Usuários do seed: joao@email.com/1234 (admin), maria@email.com/abcd (user), pedro@email.com/pass (manager)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

### ---------- Públicas ----------

GET {{baseUrl}}/

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ---------- Login (rode primeiro; o token é reaproveitado abaixo) ----------

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Sem token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### ---------- Tasks ----------

GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/search?q=bug&status=pending&priority=1&user_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Nova task via api.http",
  "description": "Criada pelo REST Client",
  "status": "pending",
  "priority": 2,
  "user_id": 1,
  "category_id": 1,
  "due_date": "2030-12-31",
  "tags": ["teste", "http"]
}

###
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.id}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "in_progress",
  "priority": 1
}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validação (400): título curto
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "title": "x" }

### ---------- Users ----------

GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastro público (role user)
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Ana Teste",
  "email": "ana.teste@email.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

###
@userId = {{createUser.response.body.id}}

### Criar admin (só com token de admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Admin Novo",
  "email": "admin.novo@email.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "role": "admin"
}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Ana Atualizada",
  "role": "manager"
}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Categories ----------

GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# @name createCategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "QA",
  "description": "Tarefas de qualidade",
  "color": "#9b59b6"
}

###
@categoryId = {{createCategory.response.body.id}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "color": "#1abc9c" }

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Reports ----------

GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/user/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Casos de erro (esperado 401) — NÃO use para obter token ----------

### Login com senha errada (401 esperado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "password": "errada"
}
